{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:0.4"], "en": "8. The Sakuṇagghi Jātaka “A hawk,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:1.1"], "en": "swooping down with great force,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:1.2"], "en": "[seized] a quail standing in its feeding ground.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:1.3"], "en": "Having suddenly encountered [the enemy],", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:1.4"], "en": "he met his death; thus, I,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:2.1"], "en": "being endowed with this method, [have attained my goal].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:2.2"], "en": "Delighting in the sphere of the mind,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:2.3"], "en": "I rejoice, free from enemies,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:2.4"], "en": "clearly perceiving my own welfare.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_168:3.1"], "en": "The Sakuṇagghi Jātaka, the eighth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
